<h1 class="page-title">Wild or Cultivated</h1>
<p class="page-intro">
  Wildlife, nature and macro photographs, split by whether the subject was
  living and growing wild or was planted and tended. A rose from a rose garden
  and a thistle from a field are both worth photographing; they are not the
  same kind of picture, and only one of them is eligible for the stricter
  nature competitions.
</p>
